+## Proof-local equation checks
+
+- `pendingSpace`: guards `P == "__"`, `P == "-" and P != "__"`, and the
+  complement of both are pairwise disjoint and exhaustive. The results are
+  respectively `"-"`, `"-"`, and `P + "_"`, exactly the nested branch.
